    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long time in solitude, something strange happens. A talking piece of meat appears in your fridge, demanding human parts to feed its hunger. Trapped in your own house, you\u2019ll need to choose who to bring home and how to deal with this odd guest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices That Count: Use dialogue to pick your visitor\u2014some are more suitable than others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Crawler Movement: Navigate your eerie home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Story Packed with Gore and Shock Value: Brace yourself for a bloody, intense tale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings: Your decisions lead to different fates\u2014will you satisfy the meat?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a true story (Not really)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515550/extras/20feffb20d08a12970e7239979cc0e25.poster.avif?t=1753163214\" width=800 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515550/extras/20feffb20d08a12970e7239979cc0e25.webm?t=1753163214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515550/extras/20feffb20d08a12970e7239979cc0e25.mp4?t=1753163214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long time in solitude, something strange happens. A talking piece of meat appears in your fridge, demanding human parts to feed its hunger. Trapped in your own house, you\u2019ll need to choose who to bring home and how to deal with this odd guest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices That Count: Use dialogue to pick your visitor\u2014some are more suitable than others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Crawler Movement: Navigate your eerie home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Story Packed with Gore and Shock Value: Brace yourself for a bloody, intense tale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings: Your decisions lead to different fates\u2014will you satisfy the meat?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a true story (Not really)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515550/extras/20feffb20d08a12970e7239979cc0e25.poster.avif?t=1753163214\" width=800 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515550/extras/20feffb20d08a12970e7239979cc0e25.webm?t=1753163214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515550/extras/20feffb20d08a12970e7239979cc0e25.mp4?t=1753163214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
